{"unit_id":"tag:0737:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003> 为指标范畴（index category）<MATH_0004> 上的图式（diagram），见《范畴（Categories）》第 <REF_0001> 节。对每个 <MATH_0005>，存在典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0006>，它诱导上同调（cohomology）上的映射（map）。因此，对每个 <MATH_0008> 以及 <MATH_0010> 的每个对象（object）<MATH_0009>，我们得到典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0007>\n这些映射（maps）一般并非同构（isomorphisms），即使对 <MATH_0011> 也是如此。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n下面的引理是《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0002> 在上同调（cohomology）中的对应结果。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"index category","target_term":"指标范畴"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层赋环位点"},{"source_term":"index category","target_term":"指标范畴","context":"图式的指标"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式","context":"层的图式"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用章名"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"余极限比较映射"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"诱导上同调映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"诱导映射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点对象"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"比较映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"比较映射的性质"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引用章名"}],"notes":[]}
